Server init.
>> a := Blob musuq: 4.
a bytes: ( Katiray musuq ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob musuq: 4.
b bytes: ( Katiray musuq ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a musuq.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Lluqsiy qillqay: ['xorred:'], sayay. 
Lluqsiy qillqay: n, sayay. 
} hapiy: { :e Lluqsiy qillqay: e, sayay. }, kallpay.
a kacharichiy.
b kacharichiy.
